#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:1 of
msgid ""
"Spectral Space Transform (SST) is a transformer used for domain "
"adaptation (calibration) applications."
msgstr "Spectral Space Transform（SST）は、ドメイン適応（キャリブレーション）用途の Transformer です。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:4 of
msgid ""
"SST is a linear transformation method used to transfer spectral data from"
" a target domain to a source (reference) domain, allowing calibration "
"models to remain valid across different instruments or acquisition "
"conditions, following the implementation by [1]_."
msgstr "SST は、[1]_ の実装に従ってスペクトルデータをターゲットドメインからソース（参照）ドメインへ転送する線形変換手法です。これにより、異なる装置や取得条件でもキャリブレーションモデルの有効性を維持できます。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:9 of
msgid ""
"The method constructs a shared latent space using singular value "
"decomposition (SVD) of concatenated source and target data, and derives "
"projection matrices to align the target data to the source space."
msgstr "この手法は、連結したソースデータとターゲットデータを特異値分解（SVD）して共有潜在空間を構築し、ターゲットデータをソース空間に整合させる射影行列を導出します。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.SpectralSpaceTransform.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:13 of
msgid ""
"Number of latent components retained from the singular value "
"decomposition (SVD). Controls the dimensionality of the shared subspace."
msgstr "特異値分解（SVD）から保持する潜在成分数。共有部分空間の次元数を制御します。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:16 of
msgid ""
"If True, center each domain's data by subtracting its mean before "
"computing the SVD. The source mean is added back after transforming."
msgstr "True の場合、SVD の計算前に各ドメインのデータからその平均を減算してセンタリングします。変換後にソース平均を加え戻します。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:19 of
msgid ""
"If True, scale each domain's data by its standard deviation after "
"centering. Features with zero variance are left unchanged (std set to 1)."
" Following the same convention as ``StandardScaler``."
msgstr "True の場合、センタリング後に各ドメインのデータをその標準偏差でスケーリングします。分散がゼロの特徴量は変更しません（標準偏差を 1 に設定）。``StandardScaler`` と同じ規則に従います。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.SpectralSpaceTransform.rst
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:24 of
msgid "Number of features seen during fit."
msgstr "fit 時に確認された特徴量数。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:27 of
msgid "Per-feature mean of the target data. Zero vector when ``with_mean=False``."
msgstr "ターゲットデータの特徴量別平均。``with_mean=False`` の場合はゼロベクトルです。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:30 of
msgid "Per-feature mean of the source data. Zero vector when ``with_mean=False``."
msgstr "ソースデータの特徴量別平均。``with_mean=False`` の場合はゼロベクトルです。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:33 of
msgid ""
"Per-feature standard deviation of the target data. Ones vector when "
"``with_std=False``."
msgstr "ターゲットデータの特徴量別標準偏差。``with_std=False`` の場合は 1 のベクトルです。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:37 of
msgid ""
"Per-feature standard deviation of the source data. Ones vector when "
"``with_std=False``."
msgstr "ソースデータの特徴量別標準偏差。``with_std=False`` の場合は 1 のベクトルです。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:41 of
msgid ""
"Projection matrix associated with the source domain. It maps the shared "
"latent space back to the source spectral space."
msgstr "ソースドメインに対応する射影行列。共有潜在空間をソーススペクトル空間へ写像します。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:45 of
msgid ""
"Projection matrix associated with the target domain. It maps target data "
"into the shared latent space."
msgstr "ターゲットドメインに対応する射影行列。ターゲットデータを共有潜在空間へ写像します。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:49 of
msgid ""
"Pseudoinverse of ``P2_``. Left factor of the low-rank correction; stored "
"to avoid recomputing the pseudoinverse on every transform call."
msgstr "``P2_`` の擬似逆行列。低ランク補正の左因子です。transform の呼び出しごとに擬似逆行列を再計算しないよう格納されます。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:53 of
msgid ""
"Effective left factor ``A_ / X_target_std_[:, None]`` with target scaling"
" absorbed. Equals ``A_`` when ``with_std=False``."
msgstr "ターゲットのスケーリングを吸収した実効左因子 ``A_ / X_target_std_[:, None]``。``with_std=False`` の場合は ``A_`` と等しくなります。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:57 of
msgid ""
"Effective right factor ``(P1_ - P2_) * X_source_std_[None, :]`` with "
"source scaling absorbed. Equals ``P1_ - P2_`` when ``with_std=False``."
msgstr "ソースのスケーリングを吸収した実効右因子 ``(P1_ - P2_) * X_source_std_[None, :]``。``with_std=False`` の場合は ``P1_ - P2_`` と等しくなります。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:61 of
msgid ""
"Per-feature combined scale ``X_source_std_ / X_target_std_``. Ones vector"
" when ``with_std=False``."
msgstr "特徴量別の合成スケール ``X_source_std_ / X_target_std_``。``with_std=False`` の場合は 1 のベクトルです。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:65 of
msgid ""
"Precomputed per-feature bias that absorbs all mean and std shifts, "
"allowing :meth:`transform` to avoid intermediate array allocations."
msgstr "平均と標準偏差によるすべてのシフトを吸収する、事前計算済みの特徴量別バイアス。これにより :meth:`transform` は中間配列の確保を回避できます。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:69 of
msgid ""
"Full transformation matrix ``I + A_ @ (P1_ - P2_)`` (property, computed "
"on demand). Equivalent to ``X_scaled @ T_`` in the SST formula but never "
"materialised during :meth:`transform`."
msgstr "完全な変換行列 ``I + A_ @ (P1_ - P2_)``（必要時に計算されるプロパティ）。SST の式における ``X_scaled @ T_`` と等価ですが、:meth:`transform` の実行中に実体化されることはありません。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:74 of
msgid "Boolean flag indicating if X_source was provided during fitting."
msgstr "fit 時に X_source が指定されたかを示すブールフラグ。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.SpectralSpaceTransform.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "例外"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:78 of
msgid "If ``X`` and ``X_source`` do not have the same shape."
msgstr "``X`` と ``X_source`` の形状が同じでない場合。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:79 of
msgid ""
"If ``n_components`` exceeds ``min(n_samples, 2 * n_features)`` of the"
"     concatenated matrix."
msgstr "``n_components`` が連結行列の ``min(n_samples, 2 * n_features)`` を超える場合。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:83 of
msgid ":py:obj:`PiecewiseDirectStandardization`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`PiecewiseDirectStandardization`"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:84 of
msgid "Local standardization using moving windows."
msgstr "移動ウィンドウを使用する局所標準化。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:86 of
msgid ":py:obj:`DirectStandardization`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`DirectStandardization`"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:87 of
msgid "Global linear transformation without local windows."
msgstr "局所ウィンドウを使用しない大域的線形変換。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:90 of
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考文献"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:91 of
msgid ""
"Du, W., Chen, Z.-P., Zhong, L.-J.,Wang, S.-X., Yu, R.-Q., Nordon, A., "
"Littlejohn, D., & Holden, M. (2011). Maintaining the predictive abilities"
" of multivariate calibration models by spectral space transformation, "
"Analytica Chimica Acta, 690(1), Pages 64–70, "
"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aca.2011.02.014."
msgstr "Du, W., Chen, Z.-P., Zhong, L.-J.,Wang, S.-X., Yu, R.-Q., Nordon, A., Littlejohn, D., & Holden, M. (2011). スペクトル空間変換による多変量キャリブレーションモデルの予測能力の維持, Analytica Chimica Acta, 690(1), 64–70 ページ, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aca.2011.02.014."

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:99 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "使用例"

#: chemotools.adaptation._spectral_space_transform.SpectralSpaceTransform:100
#: of
msgid ""
"**Basic usage** >>> import numpy as np >>> from chemotools.adaptation "
"import SpectralSpaceTransform >>> >>> rng = np.random.default_rng(17) >>>"
" X_source = rng.normal(size=(100, 20)) >>> X_target = X_source * 2 - "
"rng.normal(size=(100, 20)) * 0.02 >>> >>> sst = "
"SpectralSpaceTransform(n_components=2).fit(X_target, X_source=X_source) "
">>> X_transf = sst.transform(X_target)"
msgstr "**基本的な使用方法** >>> import numpy as np >>> from chemotools.adaptation import SpectralSpaceTransform >>> >>> rng = np.random.default_rng(17) >>> X_source = rng.normal(size=(100, 20)) >>> X_target = X_source * 2 - rng.normal(size=(100, 20)) * 0.02 >>> >>> sst = SpectralSpaceTransform(n_components=2).fit(X_target, X_source=X_source) >>> X_transf = sst.transform(X_target)"

